WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.160
You don't need Botox. All you need is a banana peel.

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:07.740
Inside, a banana peel contains lutein,

00:00:07.741 --> 00:00:11.261
which is amazing for brightening the skin,

00:00:11.262 --> 00:00:15.061
fine lines and wrinkles, and also for fading hyperpigmentation.

00:00:15.062 --> 00:00:18.741
You're gonna go ahead and rub this banana peel on your skin.

00:00:18.742 --> 00:00:20.821
It's brightening, hydrating,

00:00:20.822 --> 00:00:24.181
and soothing. Just think of it as preventative Botox

00:00:24.182 --> 00:00:26.341
and focus it on your fine lines and wrinkles

00:00:26.342 --> 00:00:28.501
and anywhere you have hyperpigmentation.

00:00:28.502 --> 00:00:31.921
Do this as much as possible throughout the week,

00:00:32.159 --> 00:00:35.980
and you are going to see a huge difference in just the brightening,

00:00:35.981 --> 00:00:38.221
the hydration, and the texture of your skin.

00:00:38.222 --> 00:00:42.201
I remember my mom doing this almost every single day.

00:00:42.340 --> 00:00:43.620
Anytime there was a banana,

00:00:43.621 --> 00:00:46.661
she would make us eat the banana and she take the peel.

00:00:46.662 --> 00:00:48.441
So once you're done rubbing it,

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:50.460
just leave it on for 10 minutes

00:00:50.461 --> 00:00:53.261
and then go ahead and wash it off with warm water.

00:00:53.262 --> 00:00:56.581
Do this consistently, and I can promise you you're not gonna need Botox.

00:00:56.582 --> 00:00:58.201
How easy was that?
